aspects of this 'vacuophobia'. One is no longer burnt at the stake for usin=
g negative numbers or imaginary numbers but these were looked upon with sus=
picion in Europe even in the 1700's. I cannot find the quote from Thomas Aq=
uinas that warns against mathematicians and other false prophets because I =
